  unitName: Hallowed Dance Sefia
  unitId: 50167
  unitNumber: 1697
  description: Sefia chose to side with humanity and abandon the gods when war broke
    out, but her symbolic eight blades were a gift from the gods. If she had cast
    off the weapons she once cared for so deeply, as though casting off the very
    gods themselves, Sefia might have taken up the weapons of her one-time deadly
    foe. If she had continued to build her own strength through battle, she might
    have carved out a future of her own design, according to her own wishes.
  summonDesc: I want to fight.<br>This is my fight.<br>Do you understand that feeling?
  fusionDesc: I learned a lot from her.<br>This joy in improving myself is a big
    part of that.
  evoDesc: In sharpness, strength, and speed. I am now so much more than these eight
    blades. I never thought I could grow so much, you know?
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
